OL,3,AAndy Burnham praises UK-EU ties in
OL,4,Ameeting with Emmanuel Macron
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has praised
OL,7,Fthe UK-EU relationship as he held talks
OL,8,Fwith French President Emmanuel Macron
OL,9,Fabout issues such as small boat
OL,10,Fcrossings in the English Channel and
OL,11,Fdefence.
OL,13,FThe pair shook hands and posed for
OL,14,Fphotographs alongside their wives
OL,15,Foutside 10 Downing Street on Thursday
OL,16,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
